Open Vanilla 0025: Duels, a duelist ready to fight: every weapon skill at its maximum, every spell on the bars.

On the Duels realm (OpenVanilla.Duels.Hub set), the first time a character is in the hangout each
session: every weapon skill its class can ever train is learned and set to its maximum (level x 5), with
Defense and Unarmed; and, once per character (duels_player.bars), every class spell it knows (the
highest rank) goes on a free action bar button: the main bar first, then bottom left, bottom right,
right, right 2 and bar 2; warriors, druids and rogues get the main bar's spells on their stance, form and
stealth bars too. Buttons already in use are never touched.
Owner, 2026-10-21: "put all abilities learned on bars, make sure all weapon skills are max".

